      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "content": "## 快速检索\n- 顶部 `Node` 选节点，`Level` 选日志级别；`TraceId / SpanId / ReqId / URL Path` 支持按字段直接筛。\n- 字段输入框默认值都是 `.*`，表示不过滤；填入具体值就是精确匹配，填正则也可以做模式匹配。\n- 当前结果面板会直接展示请求方法、路径、状态码、结果、请求 ID 和摘要信息，比原始 JSON 更直观。\n- 需要更复杂的多条件组合时，再进入左侧 `Explore` 使用 LogQL。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "title": "日志检索说明",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": false
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{job=\"springboot-template-jwt-api\",node=~\"${node:regex}\"} | json level=\"log.level\", trace_id=\"traceId\", span_id=\"spanId\", req_id=\"reqId\", url_path=\"url.path\", action=\"event.action\", outcome=\"event.outcome\", method=\"http.request.method\", status=\"http.response.status_code\", msg=\"message\" | level=~\"${level:regex}\" | trace_id=~\"${traceId:raw}\" | span_id=~\"${spanId:raw}\" | req_id=~\"${reqId:raw}\" | url_path=~\"${urlPath:raw}\" | label_format _raw_json=\"{{ __line__ }}\" | line_format \"action={{.action}} method={{.method}} path={{.url_path}} status={{.status}} outcome={{.outcome}} reqId={{.req_id}} message={{.msg}}\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "日志快速搜索结果",
      "type": "logs"
